notices.Description:
As part of W&F Councils Planned School Maintenance Program works are required to be undertaken to include:
• Electrical works to include: partial re-wire, new fire and security alarms;
• Mechanical works to include: replacement pipework for heating and domestic services;
• Associated fabric works to include: pipe boxing and decoration

As part of W&F Councils Planned School Maintenance Program works are required to be undertaken to include:
• Electrical works to include: distribution, fire alarm, containment, small power, LED lighting, data & communication;
• Mechanical works to include: replacement of heat emitters and pipework, replacement of domestic hot & cold-water pipework and associated works;
• Associated fabric works to include: suspended ceilings, pipe boxing and decoration
